    "collapsible_content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Highlights",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>A lightweight body serum made for the bumpy, rough-feeling skin often called “strawberry skin” or KP. A buffered blend of lactic acid and urea gently loosens the build-up that makes skin feel like sandpaper, while niacinamide and squalane keep the skin barrier calm and hydrated. Sinks in fast, layers under clothes without residue, and is gentle enough to use every day.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to Use",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Apply a thin layer to clean, dry skin on arms, thighs, shoulders or anywhere you get rough bumps. Start once daily in the evening, then build up to twice daily if your skin is comfortable with it. Follow with your usual body moisturiser and wear SPF on exposed skin during the day.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's Inside",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>10% Lactic Acid</strong> — a gentle AHA that loosens dead surface cells.<br/><strong>5% Urea</strong> — softens and holds moisture in rough patches.<br/><strong>Niacinamide</strong> — helps even out the look of redness around bumps.<br/><strong>Squalane</strong> — lightweight comfort so the acids never feel stripping.</p><p>Free from fragrance, essential oils, drying alcohol and dyes.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "collapsible_row_1",
        "collapsible_row_2",
        "collapsible_row_3"
      ],
